			"content": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"text": "<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { resolve } from '$app/paths';\n\timport { Dashboard } from 'uncial-cms/svelte';\n\timport { site } from '$lib/site.js';\n\n\tconst appSections = [\n\t\t{ id: 'redirects', label: 'Redirects' },\n\t\t{ id: 'orders', label: 'Orders', href: resolve('/admin/orders') }\n\t];\n</script>\n\n<Dashboard {site} {appSections}>\n\t{#snippet children()}\n\t\t<div slot=\"redirects\"><p>Redirects the site serves.</p></div>\n\t{/snippet}\n</Dashboard>"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"content": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"text": "Slotted markup stays in your page's light DOM and is projected into the frame, so your styles and components work unchanged. It shows once the editor is signed in, under the section's label."
