		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"content": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"text": "Slot a small screen that belongs behind the Dashboard's sign-in. Link a screen that needs its own route, data loading or server round trip. Either way the host owns its permissions: leave a section out of "
				},
